    "body": "## Summary\n- add explicit DRIVE/BICYCLE/WALK travel modes to the routing provider contract\n- keep persisted route quotes DRIVE-based and reuse their already-paid drive result\n- expose an authenticated, owner-only mode comparison endpoint for a route quote\n- compute only bicycle and walking estimates as additional provider calls\n- degrade unavailable non-driving modes without breaking the primary quote\n- show responsive Samochodem / Rowerem / Pieszo cards in the create-job UI\n- include the Google-required beta notice for walking and bicycle routes\n- add a regression test proving DRIVE is not requested twice\n\n## Cost and safety\nThe primary quote remains the source of truth for the job and live courier ETA. Comparison never changes or consumes the quote. The endpoint derives coordinates from the owned server-side quote rather than accepting arbitrary coordinates again.\n\n## Merge gate\nDo not merge until API verify, web verify and container/runtime smoke are green.",
